  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19: Health Expenditure and Livelihoods Support Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Health Expenditure and Livelihoods Support (HEALS) Program under the Countercyclical Support Facility COVID-19 pandemic response option (CPRO) aims to support the government&apos;s response to the potentially devastating health and economic impacts of the coronavirus disease (COVID-19), including though increased health sector spending and sustained funding for social protection programs.</narrative>
